## Release

Tag a semantic version and push it. The release workflow tests, creates the GitHub release and asks the Go proxy to index the tag.

```sh
git tag v0.1.0 && git push origin v0.1.0
```

Before v1.0.0 you may break the API in a minor version. After it, a breaking change needs a new major version and a `/v2` module path.
